        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Free 30-min discovery + tier recommendation (Boutique/Mid/Enterprise). Full-stack Shopify build: theme customisation, sampling flow, subscription, WhatsApp Cloud API, multi-currency (INR), IFRA + halal (GCC) compliance display, photography + video coordination, integration with Klaviyo + Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + Merchant Center. Timeline 4-16 weeks depending on tier. Post-launch retainer bundles Shopify + marketing (paid + SEO + content + WhatsApp + creator). Grounded in <a href='/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php'>Digital Marketing for Skincare + Beauty (incl. Perfume)</a> vertical + <a href='/resources/D2C_Pricing_Strategy_Beauty_Perfumes_Global_2026.php'>D2C pricing strategy for beauty + perfumes playbook</a>. Retainer starts at Rs 90,000-5 lakh.</div>
